  "stageId": "a003_06",
  "title": "杀手女皇",
  "storyCode": "OF-6",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "65fdf6e42e4c95fc58ac986903c44461292b89a935bb9a75bc61120f282e6b37",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "全、全都打倒了？我从来......都不知道你有这么厉害。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "我也想象过，但......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "所以我不想让小姐知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "但你实在是太厉害了！好帅呀，黑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "你是怎么跳那么高的！顺着墙窜上去，然后直接翻身跃下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "就在空中这么旋转，所有射击都被你躲过去了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "然后扭过身体，啪啪啪，连着把他们全都射倒！天哪！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "小姐......你这么说，我的脸会很烫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "不过，黑，我要纠正一点。刚才我可没有在命令你，我只是作为朋友在请求你而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "你如果有什么想做的事情，也可以和我说呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "嗯？我们刚才怎么说来着？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "别这么说话！朋友，是朋友！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "我......好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "呵呵。我们快去市政厅吧，不知道博士他们那里现在是什么情况......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "text": "这些饭桶，连一个小姑娘都拦不住吗？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁的保镖",
      "text": "可她是萨卡兹！而且对方还有其他好几个人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "text": "那不也就只有几个人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "text": "可、可恶的罗德岛，怎么会在这里！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红豆",
      "text": "什么嘛，感觉这些家伙，怎么比源石虫还弱的样子......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "text": "赶快把所有的人手都调过来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁的保镖",
      "text": "可是克洛宁先生......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁的保镖",
      "text": "我觉得，打不过，就是打不过！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "text": "没什么可是！别往后退啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红豆",
      "text": "呵欠......唉，博士，你找到没有啊？我还要去听LIVE呢，要是赶不上我可就亏大了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我得到了！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "嗯，已经找到账簿和债券了。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红豆",
          "text": "哦？找到了啊？果然打他们一顿是有用的嘛。陨星姐也说了，暴力有时候是必要的！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛宁",
          "text": "该，该死！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛宁",
          "text": "不管了，只要现在能逃走，手续什么的好补得很！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红豆",
          "text": "啊，博士，他从窗户逃走了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这些资料，我们把它都带上！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红豆",
          "text": "好~",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红豆",
          "text": "咦，将军他还在外面吧？感觉这个克洛宁什么的的下场会很惨啊，还不如没逃走呢......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "红豆",
          "text": "来，博士，我帮你拿！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛宁",
          "text": "哈，哈哈......该死。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛宁",
          "text": "必须，必须马上把其他人叫回来！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "text": "上一次，罗德岛的博士和贵市的锡兰小姐从那个窗户跳了出来。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "text": "时来运转，现在是汐斯塔的天灾信使克洛宁先生跳出了窗户。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "text": "人生也许很无常，先生。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛宁",
          "text": "你......你！我的手下呢？我的手下呢？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "text": "放在这里会影响游客参观。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "text": "顺便，这两位小姐已经在这里等你很久了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛宁",
          "text": "黑......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛宁",
          "text": "你们两个站在一起，也就是说......",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "也就是说你要完蛋了！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "证据现在都在我们手中，你难逃法网了，先生。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "text": "博士，请小心，他也许还会做些垂死挣扎。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛宁",
          "text": "你们......你们......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "text": "你的计划败露了，克洛宁！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
